message: "If you use BioLand-US, please cite the associated manuscript and this software."
title: "BioLand-US"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Ofori"
    given-names: "Elvis Kwame"
abstract: "Reproducible analysis for the study 'Land on paper: testing US bioenergy allocations against landholder contractual capacity'. BioLand-US tests whether land allocated to perennial biomass can be secured through voluntary contracts and whether the payments needed to recruit landholders can be supported by the biomass value."
